Patch 0002 (f64-specialisation) of fid-clarabel, spec node KRN.SOLV.CONIC.PATCH.

Specialise the generic float type to f64: `T` becomes an alias of f64, generic float parameters are removed, and `FloatT` keeps only the constructors the solver used from num-traits, which is dropped.

Rule IDs and rationale: vendor/fid-clarabel/AUDIT.toml.

